   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1830",
   "x": 4377.0,
   "y": 1232.0,
   "width": 623.4000000000003,
   "height": 80.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    ResourceManager は157箇所、AssetDatabase は95箇所から直接呼ばれている。\n    この図の緑矢印はほぼ全部それ。IO の入口の引数を Context に\n    統一するのが一番効く。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    ResourceManager は157箇所、AssetDatabase は95箇所から直接呼ばれている。\n    この図の緑矢印はほぼ全部それ。IO の入口の引数を Context に\n    統一するのが一番効く。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 12830,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 56768,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1831",
   "x": 4377.0,
   "y": 1312.0,
   "width": 254.59999999999997,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "2. Context に足りないものがある",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "2. Context に足りないものがある",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 12837,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 56799,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1832",
   "x": 4377.0,
   "y": 1332.0,
   "width": 579.0000000000003,
   "height": 60.0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "text": "    Material は OptionManager、Mesh は MainEngine(遅延解放)を直引き。\n    足りない分を Context に載せれば、直引きする理由が無くなる。\n",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "    Material は OptionManager、Mesh は MainEngine(遅延解放)を直引き。\n    足りない分を Context に載せれば、直引きする理由が無くなる。\n",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "seed": 12844,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 56830,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "frameId": null,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "i1833",
   "x": 4377.0,
   "y": 1392.0,
   "width": 475.8000000000002,
   "height": 20.0,
   "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
   "text": "3. ResourceManager.h が自分自身の Instance() を呼んでいる",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "3. ResourceManager.h が自分自身の Instance() を呼んでいる",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
